      {
        "id": 601139,
        "name": "Edwin Samoz",
        "username": "EdwinSamoz",
        "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/b2d939/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-10-17T17:41:08.817Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p>\n<p>I’m Edwin, an n8n architect based in Germany, now taking on freelance projects.</p>\n<p><strong>Proof, not just a pitch</strong><br>\nI built my own AI assistant product end to end in n8n: multi-workflow architecture, LLM agents, CRM and calendar integrations, self-hosted. <a href=\"https://youtu.be/YmBA_HiI-fo\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">[Link Demo-Video]</a><br>\nIt’s my own product, not a client project. I don’t have reference customers yet, so I’m happy to do a small first project at cost.</p>\n<p><strong>What I build for you</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>AI email agents (inbound mail → classify → reply or hand off)</li>\n<li>Lead → CRM → automatic follow-up (HubSpot and other CRMs)</li>\n<li>Calendar and Microsoft 365 automations</li>\n<li>API and database connections, LLM prompts inside workflows</li>\n<li>Everything self-hosted, with GDPR in mind</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>How I work</strong><br>\nFixed-price packages instead of hourly billing. Small first workflow, then we see if it makes sense to go further.</p>\n<p><strong>Contact</strong><br>\nLinkedIn: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/edwin-samoz\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/edwin-samoz</a><br>\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:edwin.samoz@outlook.de\">edwin.samoz@outlook.de</a></p>\n<p>What’s the most annoying repetitive task in your team right now?</p>",
